{"title":"2025年2月1日起实施！","date":"2024-10-30","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">2025</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施！<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">近日，国家档案局发布《招标投标电子文件归档规范》行业标准。《招标投标电子文件归档规范》规定了招标投标交易平台形成电子文件归档的一般方法，涵盖了招标投标电子文件归档范围以及招标投标电子文件的形成、收集、整理、归档、系统功能接口等多方面的指标和要求，为推行招标投标电子档案<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>单套制<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>管理提供了一种技术方案。标准将于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起实施。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-no-proof:yes\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}